"first/interact/proof.v": "Lemma certificate (A B : formula) : ll [dual A; tens A (dual B); B].\nProof.\napply (tens_r_ext [dual A]); cbn_sequent.\n{\n  ax_expansion.\n}\n{\n  ax_expansion.\n}\nQed.\n",
