"ordinary-classical/prove.txt": "valid (classical logic by the affine translation into affine MALL, focus engine)\n  ───── ax\n  a ⊢ a\n ──────── WR\n a ⊢ b, a\n────────── →R   ───── ax\n⊢ a → b, a      a ⊢ a\n───────────────────── →L\n   (a → b) → a ⊢ a\n ─────────────────── →R\n ⊢ ((a → b) → a) → a\n",
